# I. Corporate profile

## 1.1 Main battalion operations

RELX (formerly Reed Elsevier) is the leading global provider of information analysis and decision-making tools, based in London, United Kingdom, and listed in London and New York. Companies provide information-based solutions for professionals and business clients in various industries around the world.

Core practice areas:
- **Risk**: Data analysis solutions for insurance, financial services and government agencies such as fraud detection, identification, risk assessment (name includes LexisNexis Risk Solutions)
- **StM: ** One of the largest academic publishers in the world (names include Elsevier, ScienceDirect, Scopus, etc.)
- **Legal information**: Research and practical tools for legal professionals (including LexisNexis Legal)
- **Exhibitions**: Industry fairs and conferences (brands include Reed Exchanges)

